    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Elyse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105986637849552012094/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXH4GlDUmPUzDHcYEUpMaupP_-QPhToowibVeJw6b3Pc1ET7lPWeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "We just wanted to give a big thank you to Alexandra for always doing such an amazing job with our dog Milo! He absolutely loves visiting her, and it’s clear he feels comfortable and happy in her care. He always comes back looking and smelling fantastic—clean, refreshed, and so well-groomed. We really appreciate the care and attention she gives every time. She’s truly the best! 🐾✨",
        "time": 1749933164,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nina Poliseno",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105564861526258386896/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLSImClba4MEBZAN7eJPJynOT9tx0ShSf3VezeMQskRGiigYA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I have been taking my puppy to see Alexandra since day 1; whenever we arrive, Maze is absolutely ecstatic to see Alex, her work is phenomenal and we appreciate her patience! We have been having a hard time with matted spots and today we got our first big clean up and I couldn’t be happier! No more scruff and tangles ! Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1698108090,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chad B.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109287227829872439299/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwr2E2KX6jHyWk6MmE263prCkAJlp9VEakZx_JVqBC4nW_htMKYg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "What a great experience! Alexandra was super knowledgeable and very attentive to my dog’s needs. From the moment we walked in, she made sure my pup felt comfortable and safe. The grooming was done with care and precision, and my dog came out looking fantastic—clean, perfectly trimmed, and smelling amazing! You can really tell she has a passion for what she does. I highly recommend her services to any pet owner looking for a skilled and caring groomer. Will definitely be coming back!",
        "time": 1738963913,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Josh Fieldhouse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104088362104948948616/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpA7FQxHNLPFT4cB51DhwqFexO9ropOhF-cYNxoW7OOtron8Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend going to Alexandra for your pet grooming needs. I took our 10 year old Husky, who was quite nervous at first as we normally groom her at home, but Alexandra quickly made her feel very comfortable and was incredibly sweet & gentle with her. Alexandra did a beautiful job and she looks fantastic! We will absolutely be returning clients. Thank you so much, Alexandra! You clearly love your profession and it shows. 😊",
        "time": 1740059664,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nanda Guerrieri",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108568475028993953102/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrRloH-6dDuTxBf2hhBXPwi2mpZ3Da2PwbWzJkTtdFajWKyA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I cannot recommend Alexandra enough for her exceptional nail clipping services for my anxious dog. From the moment we walked in, Alexandra's calm and gentle demeanor put my dog at ease. She took the time to understand my dog's anxiety and worked patiently to ensure a stress-free experience. Her expertise and compassion truly shine through in her work. My dog's nails were perfectly trimmed and we now have a standing appointment every month!   Thank you, Alexandra, for your outstanding service and for making nail clipping a positive experience for my furry friend!  Highly recommended!!",
        "time": 1739472596,
        "translated": false
      }
